{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "1ba3a5e69f63b5dfe314bce18331ad8d2f5141d197ac8ff118b3e9530a3c7227", "ja": "少しだけ心配ッ", "zh": "有点担心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a3181223d8c5971b5e1813062817a602843842b12e04284f84a7ef1e53cbc55e", "ja": "海沿いの道にやってきたメンバー達。早速ラ\nンニングを開始したものの、いつの間にか鬼\nごっこになってしまう。奈緒達が楽しそうに\nはしゃぐ中、エミリーの様子がおかしいこと\nに気付くプロデューサー。", "zh": "成员们来到了海边的道路。\n一行人立刻开始跑步，\n结果不知不觉间却变成玩鬼抓人。\n在奈绪她们欢乐地嬉闹时，\n制作人发现艾蜜莉的样子有点不对劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ac8cd88204e62aa8df2ce61ee5ed5fccdfe43ae3f95d31371364a6bd8df83d2", "ja": "（今日は趣向を変えて、海沿いにやってきた。\n海風を浴びて、気持ちよく走れるといいんだが……！）", "zh": "（今天换个方式，来到了海边。\n希望她们吹着海风可以跑得舒服点……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "f2fd606971b9434c34ebcf999dd3d8a5e9a09ccc753b97fb6951760c2cfdacfb", "ja": "今日はワタシもランニングするヨー！\nみんな、よろしくネ！", "zh": "今天我也来跑步了～！\n大家请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "5874d1e10c91b9a018d43e2d2851087cf225803da02f22cf2a847e012970db4e", "ja": "よろしくお願いします、エレナさん。\n楽しく走ろうねぇ。", "zh": "请多指教，艾琳娜。\n我们一起开心地跑吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "cdf812f5ee75bc1afff14c63f6c8e734cdca5b3ffa45b313948c1afe4eaf5bf4", "ja": "私も、運動神経抜群のエレナさんの\n胸を借りるつもりで、がんばります！", "zh": "我也会向运动神经发达的艾琳娜借鉴，\n好好努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "eec4eedb0814f05bcd6d0c0ef5b3eeddedf914bae3728188ea56a97276aa5e91", "ja": "エレナのダンスは、たしかにすごいからな……。\nでも、ランニングでは負けへんで～！", "zh": "艾琳娜的舞蹈确实很厉害啊……\n不过论跑步我不会输的吼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "46f2bd556de3395f645e1fccd2ef15ec4def8a928e7ef54a61953748deb8620e", "ja": "よし、それじゃスタートの合図を出すぞ。\nみんな、位置について、よーい……スタート！", "zh": "好，那我要喊起跑的口号啰。\n大家各就各位，预备……开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "2798ef292493d4f1b5e2bb23d62c8d3c68be02f82856c62029eb5035e442d769", "ja": "スタートダッシュで、勝負を決めちゃうヨーっ！\nこのまま1位、もらっちゃうからネ♪", "zh": "我要用起跑点冲刺分出胜负～！\n就这样直接拿下第一名♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "f3faa97b5509338c8bf48720ca689739701b29ae79aeee5d6a627b5aff2a2645", "ja": "あっ、今のフライングや！　ちょっと、ちょーっとだけ\nフライングやって！　エレナ、ずるい～！", "zh": "啊！你刚才偷跑啦！有偷跑一点点、一～点点！\n艾琳娜好奸诈～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "e7772df9f38c1ec8c4c6e8020f1176c6e92f53fc47cc7b5f0554c61bcddcadf2", "ja": "お、おふたりとも、もうあんなに遠くに……。\n私も……いざ、参ります！", "zh": "两、两位已经跑得那么远了……\n我也……出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "2a9bfb25d31ac9cdd0aa3453d5b39834c9a92650e7d93792d226e6f99cec50dc", "ja": "す、スタートしていいのかい？\n出遅れちゃったけど、行ってくるかねぇ。", "zh": "可、可以跑了吗？\n虽然慢了一点，但我也出发吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "159dbcf2e5a46b588c9c5b59dd1315c9ad6e4d4aaa88f44c5ff4df8f3a64d5b2", "ja": "ゴール♪　潮風の中でランニングするの、\nとっても気持ちいいネ！", "zh": "抵达终点♪\n在海风中跑步好舒服喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "5db194944661732a888c9fe779aef16b4753e3d6cb899e76677030f6d940e24b", "ja": "ま、負けたー！　ラストスパートの伸び、\nありえへんやろ……ううっ、めっちゃ悔しいわぁ。", "zh": "我、我输了──！在最后冲刺拉开距离，\n也太超乎常人了吧……呜呜，超级不甘心啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "164bf2cde45b5e96e86fdb93a3c05d641c1263140e915919f3181c419384f36f", "ja": "ふう、あたしは3着だね。\n大きく離されなくてよかったよぉ。", "zh": "呼～我是第三个到的。\n幸好没有落后很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "e0b59cbd1b8859499663eb6dd5fbbffc4b8a93bd80d4ccd0dd259be348d0ebff", "ja": "はあ、はあ……エレナさん、すごいです……！\n私、全然、近づけませんでした……！", "zh": "呼、呼……艾琳娜好厉害……！\n我……完全……追不上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "0bd5c10811270980793b53322c54d44b77066c471291dd8162328c189453f88a", "ja": "えへへ♪　みんなで走ると、やっぱり楽しいネ！\nワタシはまだまだイケるけど、みんなはどう？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪大家一起跑步果然很开心呢！\n我是还可以再继续跑，大家呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "2e27b5a5861621ce74ae6ee48a0013d7131f5098a0fdec58823f6cc01d5a7887", "ja": "も、もちろんお相手いたします！\n大和撫子は、こんな事ではへこたれません！", "zh": "当、当然可以，我来当你的对手！\n大和抚子不会因为这种事就气馁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "ce720380e7893bf78b1932052ce3173d7e6979618174e2ae9be776ede3e100eb", "ja": "エミリー、やる気だネ！\nそれじゃ、ほらほら！　ついて来て！", "zh": "艾蜜莉很有干劲呢！\n那就来吧来吧！跟上我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "298e8d2ce9bc524e8f57cbdcdea573b3c2a37c377c13d6839ed87cf839ae82a5", "ja": "必ず、追いついてみせます！\n大和撫子、魂ーっ！", "zh": "我一定会追上你的！\n大和抚子精神──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "cde80f0b647964d2119453d613f71398dbf4eee317e8f47e22b5a3b8be1249eb", "ja": "私もエレナにリベンジせんとな！\nサッカーとランニングはちゃうってこと、教えたる！", "zh": "我也要找艾琳娜雪耻！\n我会告诉你，足球跟跑步是不一样的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "7d1c513648521ea64a0de83ca9f7f8c0be6fb961e1b8ee270274d57a8efa0b95", "ja": "それじゃあ、あたしも……それっ！", "zh": "那么我也……喝啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c7a47e8fed11beab9a8f4ca87f1d0eb8bf85104091c513de52b90c51a66ed48a", "ja": "あっ、立て続けに行っちゃったな……。\nみんなー、くれぐれも無理せずになー！", "zh": "啊，一个接一个跑走了……\n大家──千万不要硬撑喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "9272a9355a9f2d777d85bbeb22f49a5126d31380aaefa05a88e1b70f26166da8", "ja": "はあ、はあ……！　とりゃあっ！！\nよっしゃ、エレナにタッチ！　今度はエレナが鬼やで！", "zh": "呼、呼……！看我的！！\n好耶，碰到艾琳娜了！这次换艾琳娜当鬼啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "8e417f164268027268557022a11ad5e472c877089d28b1c3d085948ec4e40dd4", "ja": "ナオ、やるネー！\nよーし、ワタシも本気出しちゃうゾ！", "zh": "奈绪很行嘛～！\n好～我也要拿出真本事啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "053157da02a9ddca26d1b760e6eea594de272f74fdd0695e84b0b8f788f2dd87", "ja": "エレナさん、まだ本気出してなかったのかい！？\nあたしも本腰入れんとねぇ……！", "zh": "艾琳娜，难道你刚才都还在隐藏实力吗！？\n我也得拿出看家本领才行了哪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "3e4f5dc819145030d56b36e5bdfff23ce7a28954b84ae0f1da6eff0bab03d88c", "ja": "はあ、はあ……ふふっ、さすがエレナさんです！\n私、負けませんから！", "zh": "呼、呼……呵呵，不愧是艾琳娜！\n我不会输给你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a6707f7cd226561f2c5cbb7283b01f64476c608c87103d6f03a7dfd8acfa70e8", "ja": "（ランニングが途中から鬼ごっこになってしまった……\nでも、みんな楽しそうだ！　これはこれで……）", "zh": "（跑步跑到一半变成玩鬼抓人了……\n不过大家看起来很开心！没什么不好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "e0dcd9d916c6c821eda58bf3ee4542698770429fc113e61cd3541f1e8fe98acd", "ja": "とりゃっ！　ヒナタ、スキありだヨ！\nはい、タッチ！", "zh": "喝啊！日向有破绽！\n我碰到你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "1672a71ac7d307d18e6c02921431771db7024572d804e482fc5381c937c9a65b", "ja": "ありゃあ！？　今度はあたしが鬼かい？\nよーし、誰を狙おうかねぇ。", "zh": "哎呀！？这次换我当鬼了吗？\n好～我看看要抓谁哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "810b640847d09ea5c16c593bc2ab4925229754142ee222b1fc8105f4b26b58be", "ja": "鬼さん、こちら！　手の鳴るほうへ！\nあははっ、ひなた勝負や～！", "zh": "鬼啊，来这边！往拍手声的地方走！\n哈哈哈，日向我们来一决胜负啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "9d55056e7230a668b72d5fe4811881df0a35491cb79b939948362c5681dc5725", "ja": "ふふ……ふふふっ！　なんだか、楽しいです！\n体を動かすのって、こんなにも気持ちがいいんですね！", "zh": "呵呵……呵呵呵！感觉真开心！\n原来活动身体会让人心情这么愉快呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1031_032emi", "source_sha256": "4a741ef9b082386ca832a046062a9207c24d2f8ae6a50cf0381125e99ca1ccb0", "ja": "どこまでだって、やれそうです！\n……痛っ！　……足が……？", "zh": "不论要跑多远好像都难不倒我了！\n……好痛！……我的脚……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "caf2baf8e9c6e03ef5eb59c1ca38c998117e8f7843c030d37261ee013b3ca4b1", "ja": "エミリー！　そっちにひなた向かったで！", "zh": "艾蜜莉！日向往你那边过去啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "965b69808417200903a3fd66ea2ec92525aaf8f380b2bf7b2eb0d224bb45ba39", "ja": "は、はい！　……大丈夫、ですよね……？\nひなたさん、こっちです！", "zh": "好、好的！……应该没事吧……？\n日向，尽管来这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1034_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "b3fd26adc74633a00484e866b831de4c3810a4f54cedd708264ab58577136c67", "ja": "みんな、今日も本当によく動いたな！\n音無さん特製麦茶、たっぷり飲むといい。", "zh": "大家今天也充分活动了身体啊！\n音无小姐特制麦茶，大家要多喝一点喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "59a8a7010cd32988a73e1b8271dc57b5d099c29bd8135ad8cbb66e1be679b128", "ja": "いやぁ、今日も麦茶がうまい！　まあ、最後の方は\nただの鬼ごっこやったけどな……あはは。", "zh": "哎呀～今天的麦茶也好好喝啊！\n虽然最后变成只是在玩鬼抓人了……哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1037_018ele", "source_sha256": "0a9bbfe6b4d0df088ad3423b60c687d427f34db66fe8fae9b7583dfd08d83447", "ja": "でも、とっても楽しかったヨー♪\n全力だと、疲れも気持ちいいネ！", "zh": "不过，玩得很开心～♪\n用尽全力后，就连疲劳都是舒服的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "a742ff314941f7d7ea53e4a7f8cb5d66cebf499862831464d3b33968e2d11a04", "ja": "砂浜で鬼ごっこだから、疲れただろう。でも、おかげで\nみんなの体力は底上げされたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "因为在沙滩上玩鬼抓人，所以累了吧。\n不过多亏如此，大家的基础体力应该都提升了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1039_035hin", "source_sha256": "bb75e3d0712d843b681fffa71b9132db9622c96a523c8b7802f43d34e9bc7431", "ja": "楽しく遊べて、レッスンにもなってるなんて、\nさすがは{$P$}だねぇ。", "zh": "既玩得开心，又充分训练到了，\n真不愧是{$P$}哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1040_032emi", "source_sha256": "03eef8edd837c3e4516b639851957e73389dddebf54bb2e1e50901b7e60de9d1", "ja": "はい、私もとっても楽しく体力作りができました！\n……っ！", "zh": "对啊，我也锻炼体力锻炼得十分开心！\n……唔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "ab2c8542270de3b96a14c48c24715afbf82016605c11d05d399a5b73f54a6959", "ja": "エミリー？\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "艾蜜莉？\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "a4b98537ea731547dbacebf07dffbbc2ca047438a096b1c70956653d8e48c70f", "ja": "いえ、なんでもないです！\nどこも、まったく、なんともです……！", "zh": "没事，没什么！\n我很好，没有任何问题……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "913d2d43b216d161d6c94e45486d39ccea1eccff716c354e518c42d4173fb6db", "ja": "そうか？　なにか欲しいものがあれば\n遠慮なく言ってくれ。すぐ用意するからな。", "zh": "是吗？如果有什么想要的东西，\n不用客气尽管说，我马上帮你准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "e3d5341f416f9186cfd1bc552f25e670857a7ba61d83f311af5b831f7f459291", "ja": "はい、仕掛け人さま。\nお気遣い、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "好的，策划执行人先生。\n谢谢您的关心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "8ed15a4dcb9363ebf6f48afe775d1083e42de4abaa3c3b6e5a58bfa589cbc7f5", "ja": "みんな、改めて言っておくけど、無理は禁物だ。\n今日はよく動いたので、体をよく休めるように！", "zh": "大家，我再说一次，不可以硬撑。\n今天活动得很累了，一定要充分让身体休息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
